Definitely watch the MV! Bye-bye!

462
01:01:33,970 --> 01:01:36,670
バイバーイ！
Bye-bye!

463
01:01:53,470 --> 01:01:56,670
今宵キミのパーティ 探り合って踊り明かそう
Tonight at your party, let's dance the night away probing each other

464
01:01:56,670 --> 01:01:59,970
フラットいてハニー さぁ Calling Tonight Tonight Tonight
Floating away, honey, come on, Calling Tonight Tonight Tonight

465
